{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE2LTIwMjAvQ1JEJTIwJTI4MjAxNiUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"CRD","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/6yu0G5IIgZL1o6tx4xUVX1YbpPg.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fAgn3iepk1wBQZcnGoG2MfiWgaj.jpg","description":"The Purushottam Karandak — a real-life inter-college festival in which theater students compete head-to-head — becomes an ideological battleground in this bold,brilliant exploration of the creative impulse. IFFLA alum Kranti Kanade leaves no radical idea or experimental flourish behind as he tells the story of Chetan, an aspiring young writer who dreams of winning the competition but struggles to find his own artistic voice. After Chetan clashes with his tyrannical acting professor, he enlists his own group of misfits to perform a play against his college’s official team. If only he could come up with a great story and keep his own temper and libido in check. And should true art even be placed in a competition, where one vision is declared the best?\n\nReleased 4 Nov 2016 · India · Language: Hindi · 108 min\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2016","genres":["Drama","Romance","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.0","imdb_id":"tt5359624","moviedb_id":390836,"tmdbId":390836,"runtime":"108 min","cast":["Abhay Mahajan","Saurabh Saraswat","Mrinmayee Godbole","Pravin Tarde","Vinay Sharma","Geetika Tyagi","Isha Keskar"],"director":["Kranti Kanadé"],"writer":["Kranti Kanadé","Dharmakirti Sumant"],"released":"2016-11-04T00:00:00.000Z","country":"India","language":"Hindi","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Kranti Kanadé","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xAnrcijPbXQUlFs0wKGHUw5Ggnw.jpg"},{"name":"Abhay Mahajan","character":"Netra","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hEFEUch95BZMvOS4M0Zipu2fz5J.jpg"},{"name":"Saurabh Saraswat","character":"Chetan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kkqdozTist5MLugIlBtbwHu5Sa